        "jsCode": "// Agents are told to answer with one JSON object; pull it out robustly.\nconst raw = String($('Triage Agent').first().json.output ?? '');\nconst m = raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\nlet data;\ntry { data = JSON.parse(m ? m[0] : raw); } catch (e) { data = { parse_error: e.message, raw }; }\nreturn [{ json: data }];"
